{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q18589035","formula":"C₁₉H₁₄BrClN₂O₅","hill":"C19H14BrClN2O5","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl","Br"],"composition":{"C":19.0,"H":14.0,"N":2.0,"O":5.0,"Br":1.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Cinazepam","uk":"Циназепам"},"descriptions":{"en":"Nalobrazepam (INNTooltip International Nonproprietary Name), also known as cinazepam or BD-798 and sold under the brand name Levana in Ukraine, is an atypical benzodiazepine derivative. It produces pronounced hypnotic, sedative, and anxiolytic effects with minimal myorelaxant side effects. In addition, unlike many other benzodiazepine and nonbenzodiazepine hypnotics such as diazepam, flunitrazepam, and zopiclone, cinazepam does not disrupt sleep architecture, and the continuity of slow-wave sleep and REM sleep are proportionally increased.","uk":"Циназепам (англ. Cinazepam, лат. Cinazepamum) — атиповий снодійний препарат з групи похідних бензодіазепіну."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":629281,"mass":465.7,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC=C(C(=C1)C2=NC(C(=O)NC3=C2C=C(C=C3)Br)OC(=O)CCC(=O)O)Cl","inchikey":"NQTRBZXDWMDXAQ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"4-[[7-bromo-5-(2-chlorophenyl)-2-oxo-1,3-dihydro-1,4-benzodiazepin-3-yl]oxy]-4-oxobutanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"629281","atoms":42,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.037,"y":1.286,"z":3.084,"el":"Br"},{"x":-2.389,"y":-1.231,"z":-2.777,"el":"Cl"},{"x":2.202,"y":1.043,"z":-0.608,"el":"O"},{"x":0.888,"y":2.167,"z":-2.584,"el":"O"},{"x":2.407,"y":-0.23,"z":1.304,"el":"O"},{"x":7.48,"y":-1.082,"z":1.412,"el":"O"},{"x":7.118,"y":0.271,"z":-0.377,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.06,"y":2.382,"z":-1.411,"el":"N"},{"x":0.138,"y":-0.22,"z":-0.476,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.962,"y":0.818,"z":0.301,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.097,"y":-0.324,"z":-0.122,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.971,"y":2.038,"z":-0.392,"e